                                "sense_id": "ca00481f-3087-31af-a6a2-fa6853f9bcfa",
                                "text": "The standard of workmanship from Eastleigh Locomotive Works has often been acknowledged as being of a high order and this standard will have to be maintained - improved, even - when motive power other than steam is the mainstay of our railway system."
